      "obligation_category": "abort",
      "rationale": "An out-of-range sequence number must abort rather than answer `false`. Pins `aborts_if sequence_number == 0 || sequence_number >= next_sequence_number`. Deleting the assertion alone does not: `vote` aborts on the same range and the transaction table borrow aborts on the same key, so the abort is over-determined and no contract can see the deletion. Returning early removes every abort path.",
